+# Performance history
+
+## SessionStart health gate
+
+Measured on a 5,000-record store:
+
+| State | SessionStart p50 |
+| --- | ---: |
+| Before `quick_check` was removed from the read path | 11.9 ms |
+| After `quick_check` was removed from the read path | 1.05 ms |
+
+The after measurement includes the changes made at the same time: adding the
+trigger-maintained `fts_rows` counter and adding the body `CHECK` constraint.
+These are measured p50 values, not estimates.
